OL,3,GNEWSADefibrillator installed at pub
OL,4,Awith personal link
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign to install defibrillators
OL,7,Fhas come to an end, after a pub with a
OL,8,Fpersonal connection to the mission had
OL,9,Fone fitted.
OL,11,FIan Snowdon, who represents Didcot West
OL,12,Fon Oxfordshire County Council, has
OL,13,Fcompleted his campaign to have the
OL,14,Flife-saving equipment installed across
OL,15,Fthe town.
OL,17,FHe said he "can't even think" how many
OL,18,Fdefibrillators he has organised, but
OL,19,Fthat there had remained one final area
OL,20,Fconspicuously without one.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
