OL,3,GNEWSADefibrillator installed at pub
OL,4,Awith personal link
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat was until the landlord of The
OL,7,FWheatsheaf, on Watlington Road, offered
OL,8,Ftheir pub as the final site - with the
OL,9,Fdefibrillator installed there earlier
OL,10,Fthis month.
